								My computer is most definitely puting<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=mrtree440&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/aim.gif" alt="mrtree440" border="0" /></a>
								<br />
								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=90"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="Http://www.myspace.com/matthewcrabtreemusic" title="MTK Beats on Myspace" target="_blank"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:macktheknife440@yahoo.com"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</div>
