							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Wow. I hope your kidding? These dudes have no talent (that c-murder cover should be in the worst covers thread).. I know you have your own personal interests/opinions.. but i dont understand this. <br /><br />Project Pat&#039;s song &quot;Fuck A Bitch&quot;... CORNY ASS beat.. and for about 90 seconds it just says &quot;fuck a bitch, mothafuck a bitch..&quot;.... what kind of shit is that?!<br /><br /> <img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Smileys/default/angry.gif" alt="Angry" border="0" /></div>
